== Reward ==

<ul><li> {{:Torrid Corruptor}}
</li></ul>

== Checklist ==
{{CheckboxList}}
* Suggested tasks to complete first:
** Obtain a [[SoulFire]] via the [[Zimel's Blades (SoulFire)]] quest
** Obtain a [[Dark Reaver]] from [[A ghoul cavalier]] in [[Lower Guk]]
** Get [[Bloodsabers]] faction <b>Kindly</b> or higher - there are few ways to do this.
** Get [[Heretics]] faction <b>Warmly</b> or higher - Kill Kobolds in [[The Warrens]]
** Get [[Dismal Rage]] faction <b>Kindly</b> or higher - Do [[Assist the Great Xelha]] quest in [[East Freeport]] (requires about 1000 bone chips to turn-ins)
* Slay [[Brother Hayle]] in [[Splitpaw Lair]] prison area - <b>cell doors open via switches</b>!
** Loot and right-click on [[Burning Soul of the Pious]]
* Find [[Lord Grimrot]] in [[Southern Karana]] - <b>MUST BE LIVING VERSION!</b>
** Give Lord Grimrot [[Dark Reaver]] and right-clicked [[Burning Soul of the Pious]] - <b>requires [[Bloodsabers]] Kindly faction</b>!
** Right-click the [[Burning Soul of the Pious]] he hands you back - <b>make sure it does not have any text in the chat window; if it does, your turn-in did not work (probably due to faction)</b>!
** Kill Lord Grimrot
** Loot [[Pestilence Scythe]] - <b>the one with charges; the other one doesn't matter for this quest</b>.
* Find [[Jotayi Ibupran]] in [[Paineel]] (Necromancer Guild balcony)
** Give Jotayi Ibupran [[Pestilence Scythe]] (the one with charges) and [[Burning Soul of the Pestilent]] - <b>requires [[Heretics]] Warmly Faction</b>!
* Find [[Dason Goldblade]] in [[Plane of Sky]] Efreeti Chamber (quest room) - <b>MAKE SURE YOU ARE KEYED UP TO ISLAND 4 BEFORE SEEKING HIM OUT</b>!
** Give [[Dason Goldblade]] 500pp to spawn [[Inte Akera]] inside the Windmill on Island 4 - <b>be quick, he will eventually despawn</b>.
** Kill [[Inte Akera]] and loot the [[Burning Soul of the Virtuous]]. ''Note: If you are in a group, the soul is linked to whoever turns in the 500 platinum to spawn Inte.''
*  Find [[Luxio Nulsis]] in [[East Freeport]] (Shadowknight spell vendor basement area)
** Give [[Luxio Nulsis]] the three Souls and [[Soulfire]] - <b>Requires [[Dismal Rage]] Kindly faction</b>!
{{End}}

== Walkthrough ==

;Burning Soul of the Pious

;Burning Soul of the Pestilent
*Next part requires [[Bloodsabers]] Kindly Faction.
**You can gain [[Bloodsabers]] faction by doing the [[Guard Shilster's Stout]] or [[Gharin's Note (evil)]] quest.
**By doing Guard Shilster's Stout, give 5 gold at a time to [[Guard Shilster]] (1380, -2764) in [[Northern Plains of Karana|North Karana]]. Takes about ~3000 gold to max out all of his factions.
*Find [[Lord Grimrot]] (1377, 1172) by the skeletons in [[South Karana]]. There's a living and undead version with the same name. '''The turn-in requires the living version.''' It's rumored to be a 3.2-hour spawn. One of the fastest ways to spawn Lord Grimrot is to make an instance right at 6am. Use <code><nowiki>/time</nowiki></code> to see the in-game time.
*Turn in the clicked version of [[Burning Soul of the Pious]] and [[Dark Reaver]] to the living version of Lord Grimrot.
**:Lord Grimrot says, 'You have served me well. You may yet prove useful to my master.'
